<h1 class="text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-brandBlue uppercase italic tracking-tighter mb-4 leading-tight">Korea KC Certification for Power Bank Importers: Safety Confirmation vs Certification</h1>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
<img src="/image/factory/team-snowy.webp" alt="Snowy May, Marketing Manager & Founder at WOWOHCOOL" loading="lazy" width="750" height="750" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover border border-brandOrange" decoding="async">
