</div>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">If you are also verifying the factory's other certificates, our guide to <a href="/blog/verify-fake-charger-certificates-fcc-ce-ul/">verifying FCC, CE, and UL certificates</a> covers the database checks. The same discipline applies to a KC report: confirm the certificate number, model, and holder in the official system rather than on a PDF alone.</p>
</div>
